Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(ci):=20main=20red=20=E2=80=94=20pin=20utf-8?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20on=20wait-check=20ssh=20subprocess;=20redaction=20test=20nam?=
 =?UTF-8?q?es=20a=20human=20ask?=
